  "abstract": "Add LayerNorm in factor space to FourierMix-FLoad (M=12) before the harmonic and increment heads. Hypothesis: LN stabilizes frequency head and improves generalization. Train with MAE+curvature (\u03bb=1e-4), Adam, Clip=1.0.",
